See README-DEV for upstream bug reports we're waiting on to be resolved.

Note: the libboost-process v2-header inclusion question (whether the idiomatic
include changed from <boost/process/v2.hpp> to <boost/process.hpp>) was
resolved during the 1.91.0 upgrade: it did change. As of 1.91.0, V2 is the
default (<boost/process.hpp>) and V1 moved to <boost/process/v1.hpp>. The
<boost/process/v2.hpp> umbrella no longer exists. See README-DEV section 2.15.
